			"notes": "## What's Changed\n* Removed onUpdate by @Lumitani-pixel in https://github.com/mioclient/oyvey-ported/pull/33\n* Added Notifications by @Lumitani-pixel in https://github.com/mioclient/oyvey-ported/pull/34\n* Changed the Event system by @Lumitani-pixel in https://github.com/mioclient/oyvey-ported/pull/35\n* feat: inventory utils by @cattyngmd in https://github.com/mioclient/oyvey-ported/pull/39\n* Update OyVey to 1.21.11 by @xgraza in https://github.com/mioclient/oyvey-ported/pull/43\n* Rewrite command system in favor for brigadier by @xgraza in https://github.com/mioclient/oyvey-ported/pull/45\n* Fix notifications module by @xgraza in https://github.com/mioclient/oyvey-ported/pull/47\n* Minor improvements by @xgraza in https://github.com/mioclient/oyvey-ported/pull/48\n* Fix gradle run failing because of `generateBuildConfig` by @xgraza in https://github.com/mioclient/oyvey-ported/pull/49\n* Experimental logless chat messages by @qu1ckplay in https://github.com/mioclient/oyvey-ported/pull/54\n* use Color.getRGB() instead of manual bit-shifting by @qu1ckplay in https://github.com/mioclient/oyvey-ported/pull/56\n* Fixed Bind system doesn't detect mouse keys by @uefibootkit in https://github.com/mioclient/oyvey-ported/pull/57\n\n## New Contributors\n* @xgraza made their first contribution in https://github.com/mioclient/oyvey-ported/pull/43\n* @qu1ckplay made their first contribution in https://github.com/mioclient/oyvey-ported/pull/54\n* @uefibootkit made their first contribution in https://github.com/mioclient/oyvey-ported/pull/57\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/mioclient/oyvey-ported/compare/1.21.10...1.21.11"
